<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Confirma tu correo en Snowbreak</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f0f2f5;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f0f2f5;padding:40px 16px;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center">
      <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;">

        <!-- LOGO -->
        <tr>
          <td align="center" style="padding-bottom:24px;">
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1a1a1a;">&#10052; SNOWBREAK</p>
          </td>
        </tr>

        <!-- TARJETA PRINCIPAL -->
        <tr>
          <td style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;padding:40px 40px 32px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">

            <!-- ICONO -->
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td align="center" style="padding-bottom:28px;">
                  <div style="display:inline-block;background:#e8f0fb;border-radius:50%;width:64px;height:64px;line-height:64px;text-align:center;font-size:28px;">&#9993;</div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- TITULO -->
            <h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;text-align:center;">Confirma tu correo</h1>
            <p style="margin:0 0 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#555555;text-align:center;">Hola <strong>{{.Nombre}}</strong>, gracias por unirte a Snowbreak.<br>Pulsa el bot&#243;n para activar tu cuenta:</p>

            <!-- BOTON -->
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td align="center" style="padding-bottom:28px;">
                  <a href="{{.URL}}" style="display:inline-block;background:#1a6fc4;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;padding:16px 40px;border-radius:8px;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Confirmar mi correo &#8594;</a>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- SEPARADOR -->
            <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;margin:0 0 24px;">

            <!-- URL DE RESPALDO -->
            <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;color:#999999;text-align:center;">Si el bot&#243;n no funciona, copia este enlace en tu navegador:</p>
            <p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:12px;word-break:break-all;color:#1a6fc4;text-align:center;">{{.URL}}</p>

            <!-- AVISO -->
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#f8f9fa;border-radius:8px;">
              <tr>
                <td style="padding:16px 20px;">
                  <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#666666;line-height:1.5;">&#9200; El enlace caduca en <strong>{{.HorasTTL}} horas</strong>. Si no has creado esta cuenta, puedes ignorar este correo.</p>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>

          </td>
        </tr>

        <!-- FOOTER -->
        <tr>
          <td align="center" style="padding:24px 0 0;">
            <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px;color:#888888;">
              <a href="https://snowbreak.es" style="color:#1a6fc4;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">snowbreak.es</a>
              &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;
              <a href="mailto:hola@snowbreak.es" style="color:#888888;text-decoration:none;">hola@snowbreak.es</a>
            </p>
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:11px;color:#bbbbbb;">Tu plataforma para planificar viajes de esqu&#237;</p>
          </td>
        </tr>

      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
